<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">ROME</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rome</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaana Poole kundaa basi Rome</para>
  <para style="mt2">MUKAANA A POOLE KUNDAA BASI</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROME</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu mukaana wu ósono Poole kundaa banga-a-kana baba ku Rome. Nde nkini áli ka amaagye oko o, lo mbwuru mukimi áaluo baara baba oko ya áasohobo Nzaami a Yiisu-Kriste oko. Poole ásono bo mukaana mpaala bo basoolo nde. Me mu obo nde ásono bo ti ŋa akala aagye nde ku Esepaanye, nde sa abululuru kundaa bo mpaala agwa bo mpama mu onama nzili a Kriste. Nde áluomo boho si mu osamana mu nde mpaala nde abagha mpeene yi ogye midzie.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu mukaana wu, Poole ásuo bo mandagha ma maluru bubwe mu kana li bo mu Kriste. Nde ályele ti baara bwohono bási masumu, ya bákuono a nsia a Nzaami. Lo mu matala ma, bo bakughu obvurulu endughu ya Nzaami mu bumõ ya Yiisu-Kriste. Nzaami ásuolo Poole mu okala ntumu mpaala atsala nsia yi a Ndagha yi Mbwe. Poole ályele ti Ndagha yi Mbwe me lileene li Nzaami kundaa nswe munde wu a aasa kana. Mu obo, ka bakughu ofirilyele o ti wu li mu-Dzwife, bwunu we ka li mu-Dzwife o. Ŋa mihi mi Nzaami, banga-a-kana bwohono bali embe-embe, ka oli a mbwuru wu bvulu nganda a nde o. Nzaami aakamono baara bwohono baba bunsumu, bwunu a bu ookalyele Bisono bibi Ngili ti: «Munde wuli wu a nsumu mu nkooro a kana sa akala wu a mweẽ» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">1.17</ref></char>). Poole áfirilyele ti banga-a-kana bwohono bafaana ogwihini, mbwuru si mumõ ka abele nganda a nde o, ka asyeme nde o, anyaã olamana ndehe si, ngu okala ti nzya-nzyara a nde ka yili bumõ ya yi a ndaa nde o.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaana wu, wu ósono Poole kundaa basi Rome li nkara mubwe, ya obaana oŋo, bakriste bágyagha nde bubwe.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Bu me bu baakakaba mukaana wu:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Poole tsala nsia a Ndagha yi Mbwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-17">1.1-17</ref></char>),</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Baara bwohono baasi masumu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1.18–3.20</ref></char>),</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Bunu-abo Nzaami aakamono baara ti bo baara baba bunsumu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3.21–4.25</ref></char>),</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Baara ba Nzaami sa babagha laama li linyaghara (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5.1–8.39</ref></char>),</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Nzaami aanyaghala Isarayele, lo ka mu matala mwohono o (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9.1–11.36</ref></char>),</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Bumweẽ bu bunyaghara bubu dzyi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12.1–15.13</ref></char>),</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Mandagha ma okuru Poole ya mamboro (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15.14–16.27</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nsia yi Mbwe yi ookatsala Poole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Me Poole, musala a Yiisu-Kriste, wu báti mbili mu okala ntumu ya wu básuolo mu otsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Nzaami ágwi misiini mimi Nsia yi Mbwe yi kundaa mibighili mi nde mu Bisono bibi Ngili. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Yo yitala Mwana a nde, wuulu mu musunu li mu musyi a dzumu li Dabvide. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Baatwulu Yiisu-Kriste Mfumu a bihi Mwana a Nzaami ya lileene, bwunu a bu oli Mufulu wu bungili, mu nkooro a osighili o nde ŋa kara li ba bákpi. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Me mu nde, me aabagha bwehe baa okala ntumu mu obiri bitswumu byehene mu okala a bintamana bibi kana, mu nsia a nkwumu a nde. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Behe si lili bamo mu baara ba bo, be ba ooti Yiisu-Kriste mbili. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Me nsono mukaana wu kundaa be bwohono ba lili mu bvulu lili Rome, be ba ookadzyi Nzaami mu mukolo ya ba áti nde mbili mu okala baba ngili: Nyaã bwehe ya edzuunu, bi bifi kundaa Nzaami Taara a bihi ya kundaa Mfumu Yiisu-Kriste bikala ya be.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole dzyi oyimono bakeretyẽ ba bali ku Rome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Nsomo, me mbvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami a me mu Yiisu-Kriste mu nkooro a be bwohono, mu kuulu bali mu okabili mu kana li be mu nsie nsyini. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nzaami, wu aakansalala me mu mukolo mumõ mu Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Mwana a nde, li mpughulu a me ti me aakantsimi mu be matala mwohono ma aakantsamana me. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Mu nsamana a me, me aakanduomo waa li Nzaami, mpaala me mbagha mpeene yi ogya kundaa be. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Mu kuulu me ndi a nzala a omono be ku olagha, mpaala me ngyaha be ekaba kii mufulu, ekaba kii bwehe mu kuulu be ligwama. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Bwunu we mpaala, kundaa be, bihi bwohono libagha bukyini, nswe mbwuru mu kana lili ndaa wu muke. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, me ndzyi be lisoolo ti matala malagha me aakantsimi ogya kundaa be, mu obagha mana bimburu kundaa be ya kundaa bitswumu bibike. Lo tee sonali, bali mu okakahaba me. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Me ndi a ebyimi kundaa ba-Ngereke ya kundaa banzyi, kundaa bansughu ya kundaa ba bagwene soolo mandagha. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Mu obo me ndi a maangu nzala a otsala Nsia yi Mbwe kundaa behe si ba lili ku Rome.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lileene li Nsia yi Mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Mu kuulu me ka ndi a budzwa bu Nsia yi Mbwe o, mu kuulu yo yili lileene li Nzaami mu obvwughu o nswe munde wu aasa kana, nsomo mu-Dzwife, ŋa nseele mu-Ngereke. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Mu kuulu, me yo yiikasuo bu ookasa Nzaami baara bunsumu mu nzili a kana ya mu nkooro a kana, ti bwunu a bu básono ti: «Munde wuli wu a nsumu mu nkooro a kana sa akala wu a mweẽ.»<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Engaŋma ki básweghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Mu obo, obaana ku yulu, nkehe a Nzaami yili mu okamoŋono kundaa baara ba bagwene a enzaami ya ba bagwene a bunsumu, ba baakasweghe engaŋma kunsa ogwene a bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Mu kuulu mandagha ma bakughu osoolo mu Nzaami mali mu okamoŋono ŋa kara li bo. Me Nzaami aasuo bo mo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Mu obo, mandagha ma maagwene okamoŋono kundaa nde, mbaala ti, lileene li nde lili mibvu ya mibvu ya bunzaami bu nde, maagyighili okamoŋono obaana ku bágyighili nsie, mu matala ma ookasa mayele lisobo mu bigyighili bi nde. Me mu obo bo ka bakughu obagha obvwughu o, <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />mu kuulu bu basoolo Nzaami, bo ka baasyighi nde ti anga Nzaami o, ya ka baabvurulu nde matuono o. Lo bo bágwuŋumu kunsa bitsimi bi bigwene a mupfunu ya mikolo mi bo mi migwene a mayele miisomo kunsa mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Bu batsimi ti bo bali bansughu, bo ayi banga-a-lala, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />ya bo baasobo nsia a Nzaami wu aagwene okakpa mu bidzili a dzili bi bili efaana e mbwuru wu aakakpa, kii baŋmini, kii banyama ba bali a myili mina ya kii banyama ba baakagye mu etulu.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Me mu obo Nzaami anyaghala bo mu okala kunsa mandagha mama osuŋumu mu dzyi li mikolo mi bo, mpaala bo-a-bo banyaã ogwa manyuru ma bomo budziri. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Bo baasobo engaŋma e Nzaami mu mpya, ya baakabuono bilogho bi ógyighili Nzaami, bu baakasamana bye ŋa ebini e ndeme. Masyighi kundaa nde mu mibvu ya mibvu! «Aamene!»<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Me mu obo Nzaami aatyeghe bo mu dzyi li mandagha ma maakatwuhu budzwa. Mu obo, bakaha ba bo ka baafirikabvughu mbughu ya babaghala o, lo baakabvughu mbughu ya bambaala bakaha. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Bumõ si kundaa babaghala, bu banyaã ofirikabvughu mbughu ya bakaha, bo baalughulu mu mbaa a dzyi li okabvughu mbughu bo-a-bo, mu okagyighili mandagha mama bupfiri babaghala ya babaghala, ya bo baabagha mu manyuru ma bo masyeme ma mafaana ya ogwuŋumu o bo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Mu kuulu bo baatsimi ti ka oli bubwe mu osoolo Nzaami o, Nzaami aatyeghe bo ku mayele ma bo ma magwene a bunsughu. Me mu obo bo baakagyighili mandagha ma magwene ofaana. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Bo balwulu mu mandagha mama mawa-mawa ma magwene a bunsumu, mu mokolo bubi, mu ntono a nzi, mu okagyighili mandagha ma mabi, bo balwulu mu musogho, mu odzwa baara, mu mumbaŋana, mu bintwaã, mu bipfu bi bibi, mu okaburulu banganda mandagha, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />mu okabili bubi mu banganda, mitaara mi Nzaami, banga a eŋma, banga a ligwagha, banga a mubili a nyuru, banga a bitsimi bubi, ba baakabihi litumu li ba báburu bo. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Bo ka bali a mayele o, ka baakanama mukihi wu bálaba o, ka bali a nyiĩ o, ka bali a ngebe o. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Ya ngu okala ti bo basoolo ti Nzaami ákehe baara ba baakagyighili mandagha mama obo lipfu, bo ka yini a ogyighili baakagyighili mo o, lo bo baakakihi si ba baakagyighili mo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mumfwunu a Nzaami wu bunsumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />We, nswe ka nande we li, we wu aakalamana baara, ka bakughu osa we kolokolo o. Mu kuulu, we wu aakalamana babake, ya weme si aakagyighili mandagha maana mamo, we nyuru a weme aakasyeme. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Ankoho bihi lisoolo ti olamana o Nzaami oli kuu ngaŋma kundaa baara ba baakagyighili mandagha mama obo. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />We wu aakalamana ba baakagyighili mandagha mama obo, ya weme si aakagyighili mo, we bunu tsimi, ti we sa bvwughu mu mumfwunu a Nzaami? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Bwunu we, we wu aakatsaala busini bubu bubwe bu Nzaami, mukolo a nde wu munene okuru mukolo a nde mu okebe, we ka soolo o ti bubwe bu Nzaami bufaana obiri we ku ogyiŋi mayele? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Mu nkooro a mutswi mpini a we, we li mu okabihi ogyiŋi mayele. Me mu obo we li mu okakwu ŋa yulu a weme nkehe yi nene mu etsughu ki akala oomoŋono nkehe ya mumfwunu a Nzaami wu bunsumu, <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />wu «akala aabvurulu kundaa nswe mbwuru bwunu a bu oli bigyighili bi nde». <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Nzaami sa agwa laama lili mibvu ya mibvu kundaa babo baala mu mukama a bo wu okasa bubwe, bo baakasagha nsia, budziri ya bumweẽ bu buugwene okafa. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Lo Nzaami sa asyeme mu nkehe yi alagha babo ba baakanama bitsimi bi bomo, baakabihi engaŋma ya bali kunsa litumu li mandagha ma magwene a bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Mpara ya minyoõ kundaa nswe mbwuru wu aakasa mandagha ma mabi, nsomo kundaa mu-Dzwife, ya kundaa mu-Ngereke si. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Lo Nzaami aakagwa nsia, budziri ya edzuunu kundaa nswe munde wu aakasa bubwe, nsomo kundaa mu-Dzwife, ŋa nseele kundaa mu-Ngereke. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Mu kuulu Nzaami ka ali a munsuolo mu baara o.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Baara bwohono ba baasi masumu gwene a Mikyene osoolo, sa bapfighili si gwene a Mikyene. Ya baara bwohono ba baasi masumu kunsa Mikyene, sa balamana bo mu Mikyene. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Mu kuulu, ka oli baara ba baakagyughu Mikyene bali baba nsumu ŋa busu bu Nzaami o, lo babo ba baakasalala Mikyene baakala baba bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Mu matala maala baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, ba bagwene soolo Mikyene, baakasalala mi ookatumu Mikyene, mono ti anga bo bali a Mikyene mu mikolo mi bo, ankoho bo ka basoolo Mikyene o. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Bo baakasuo ti bigyighili bi ookatumu Mikyene básono bye munsa mikolo mi bo. Embwuru e bo eekasuo si bumpughulu mu bo, bumõ si ya bitsimi bi bo biili matala mana biikafwunu bo ya matala ma make biikakala bo. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Mandagha mamo sa mamoŋono mu etsughu ki oolamana Nzaami mansweghe ma baara mu Yiisu-Kriste, ti bwunu a bu oli Nsia yi Mbwe yi aakansala me.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkyini a Isarayele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Lo kala ti we wu li a nkwumu yi a mu-Dzwife, we aasiŋi mu Mikyene ya li a mutwunu mu Nzaami a we, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />we wu soolo waa li nde, Mikyene miiluo we bu osuolo bubwe bu ofaana osa mbwuru, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />we wu aakatsimi ti we li mumbiri a binkpa-mihi, otsyeme o ba bali kunsa mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />muluo a ba bagwene a ligyahaba ya muluo a bike-bike, mu kuulu we akatsimi ti mu Mikyene we li a ligyahaba ya engaŋma. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Lo we, wu aakaluo babake, we ka li mu okaluo weme o! We wu aakaluo ti ka bafaana oturu o, we li mu okaturu! <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />We wu aakalighi ti ka bafaana obvughu mbughu ya mukala bwunu we mulumu a nganda-mbwuru o, we li mu okabvughu mbughu ya mukala bwunu we mulumu a nganda-mbwuru! We wu aakabele bityeghe, we aakagwolo bilogho bi bili mu bibini bi baakasamana bye! <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />We wu li a mutwunu mu Mikyene, we ka aakagwa Nzaami budziri o, bu aagwene okasalala Mikyene! <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Mu kuulu básono ti: «Me mu nkooro a be bikaana bi banzyi biikatsaala nkwumu a Nzaami.»<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Mu engaŋma, osomo nzo a mbaa oli mupfunu kala ti we aakasalala Mikyene. Lo kala ti we aakatsumunu Mikyene, we li ti anga mbwuru wu áagwene osomo nzo a mbaa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Kala ti mbwuru wu áagwene somo nzo a mbaa aakasalala litumu li Mikyene, Nzaami ka kughu otala nde ti anga mbwuru wu áasomo nzo a mbaa o? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Mbwuru wu áagwene osomo nzo a mbaa mu nyuru a nde, wu aakasalala Mikyene, ka akala alamana we o, we wu aakatsala mye, ngu okala ti we li a mukaana a Mikyene ya aasomo nzo a mbaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Mu-Dzwife wu a ngaŋma ka oli munde wu aakamoŋono mu mihi o, ya osomo nzo a mbaa kuu ngaŋma ka oli elyimi ki baakamono mu nyuru o. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Lo mu-Dzwife wu a ngaŋma me munde wu li mu-Dzwife kunsa mansweghe. Osomo nzo a mbaa o nde oli kuu mukolo ku ookagwa Mufulu a Nzaami, lo ka oli kuu mukaana wu básono o. Mu-Dzwife wu a ngaŋma munde ka aakabagha masyighi ma maakafa kundaa baara o, lo ma maakafa kundaa Nzaami.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nkyini a baara bwohono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Mu obo, mu emakye okala mu-Dzwife obvulu bitswumu bibike? Mupfunu wu osomo nzo a mbaa ŋana-aŋo ali? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Mupfunu li wu munene mu mandagha malagha! Mu kuulu, nsomo, kundaa ba-Dzwife Nzaami ágwi Ndagha a nde okebe. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Lo emakye? Kala ti ba-Dzwife babake bagwene a kana, ogwene a kana o bo okughu osa kuulu ti Nzaami anyaã okebe mukihi wu álaba nde? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Si okala ka bunu! Nyaã Nzaami akala wu a ngaŋma ya nswe mbwuru akala nga-a-mpya, ti bwunu a bu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Mpaala bamono we wu bunsumu mu mandagha ma we»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«ya we lughulu ŋa baakasa we muyala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bik. 51.6, ti bu básono mu mikaana mi mikulu mu engereke.</char></note>».<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Lo kala ti ogwene a bunsumu bu bihi-a-be buukasuo empakala bunsumu bu Nzaami, mayo bihi liilyele? Nzaami ka li a bunsumu o ŋa aakakolo nde nkehe? Me mu embwuru ndi mu okabili. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Si okala ka bunu! Kala pele, lo bunu a bo Nzaami akala aalamana nsie? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Lo kala ti mu mpya a me engaŋma e Nzaami eli mu okakulu mu nkooro a nsia a nde, lo mu emakye bali mu ofirilamana me ti anga nga-a-masumu? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ya mu emakye liigwene olyele ti anga bu ookatsimi ba baakapfiri mpya ndiri bihi liikaluo ti: «Bihi-a-be litswe likasa o bihi bubi mpaala bubwe bumoŋono mu bo!» Baara baba obo bafaana osyeme bo.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Lo bunu odzyi olyele? Bihi-a-be ba-Dzwife libvulu bikaana bibike? Komo pele! Mu kuulu bihi liitswama osuo ti: baara bwohono, ba-Dzwife ya ba-Ngereke, bali kunsa litumu li masumu. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Bwunu a bu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">«Ka oli a mbwuru wu a nsumu o, ka oli a si mumõ o,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Bik 14.1-3; 53.2-4.</char>
    </note> Ka oli a mbwuru si mumõ wu li a mayele o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">ka oli si mumõ wu aakasagha Nzaami o.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bo bwohono baagwuŋumu, mu emvughu bo ayi baara ba baagwene okasa dzyi li Nzaami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">ka oli a si mbwuru mumõ wu aakasa bubwe o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">ka oli a si mumõ o.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Miguolo mi bo mili ti mpyeme yi a bwaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">bo baakasalala manzalisogho mabo mu okapfiri mpya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">mu bibolo bi bo oli a misuo mi mpili,<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Bik 10.7.</char>
    </note> miŋma mi bo milwulu mu bipwolo ya mu mandagha mama nkala.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">3.15 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Edz 59.7s; Man 1.16.</char>
    </note> Myili mi bo mileŋe mu okabulutsala makili,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />mu manzili mwohono ma baakaluru bo, bo baakatsala bilogho byehene ya baakasihi nyiĩ,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">3.17 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Edz 59.7-8.</char>
    </note> bo nkini ka bamaagyahaba nzili yi a edzuunu o.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Bik 36.2.</char>
    </note> Budziri bu Nzaami ka buli ŋa mihi mi bo.»<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Ankoho bihi lisoolo ti mandagha mwohono ma ookalyele Mikyene, mye miikalyele mo kundaa baara ba bali kunsa litumu li Mikyene, mpaala nswe muŋma akala wu a nkunkuru, ya nsie yohono yikala a ebili ŋa busu bu Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Me mu obo ka oli a mbwuru wu aakala wu a nsumu ŋa nkulu a Nzaami mu bigyighili bi Mikyene o, buulu Mikyene yini a ligyahaba li masumu miikagwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzaami aakasa baara bunsumu mu kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Lo mu matala ma, gwene a mikyene, Nzaami aasuo bihi-a-be bu aakasa nde bihi-a-be baba nsumu ŋa nkulu a nde. Mikaana mi Mikyene ya mibighili miikasuo bumpughulu mu yo. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Baara bwohono ba baakasa kana Nzaami aasi bo bunsumu mu nkooro a kana li bo mu Yiisu-Kriste. Mu kuulu ka oli a lisobo ŋa kara li bo o: <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Mu kuulu bo bwohono baasi masumu, ya baagwene obagha nsia a Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Lo gwene a ofiri nzi, baasi bo baara baba bunsumu mu bwehe bu Nzaami, mu nzili a okwulu ku oli mu Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Nzaami aasuolo nde ti anga ekaba kii ofughu masumu mu makili ma nde, mu nzili a kana, mu osuo bunsumu bu nde. Mu kuulu nde ka ásyeme masumu ma ósi baara mu nsi-nkulu o <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />mu kuulu nde li a mukolo wu munene. Nzaami aadzyi osuo bunsumu bu nde mu matala ma, nde li wu a nsumu, bu atwulu munde wu si kana mu Yiisu nsumu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ndagha yi okasa mutwunu ŋana yili? Pele, yo ka yifaana okala o! Mu nki mikyene? Mu mikyene mi bigyighili? Pele, lo mu mikyene mi kana. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Mu kuulu bihi litsimi ti Nzaami aakasa mbwuru akala wu bunsumu mu kana, gwene a osalala mi mikyene. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Bwunu we, Nzaami li yini a wu a ba-Dzwife? Nde ka li si Nzaami a baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o? Eẽ, nde li si Nzaami a baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />kala ti oli ngaŋma ti Nzaami li yini a nga-mumõ: Me nde aasa ba básomo nzo a mbaa ya ba bágwene osomo nzo a mbaa bakala baara baba bunsumu mu kana. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Mu obo, limaha oko Mikyene mu nkooro a kana? Si okala ka bunu! Lo bihi ligyighili onyeme ti Mikyene mikala.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Efaana kii Abarahame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Mu obo, bihi emakye liilyele mu Abarahame, nkagha-kwuru a bihi mu musunu? Nde emakye ábagha? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Mu kuulu, kala mu bigyighili Nzaami ási ti Abarahame akala wu bunsumu, nde kughu okala a mutwunu. Lo ŋa nkulu a Nzaami ka oli obo o! <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Mu kuulu, Bisono emakye biikalyele? «Abarahame ási kana mu Nzaami, me mu lo Nzaami átala nde ti anga mbwuru wu bunsumu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Eba 12.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6-9">Nga 3.6-9</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Ankoho kundaa munde wu si esala, ka bakughu otala mufuru a nde ti anga bwehe o, lo mufuru a nde li ti anga ebyimi ki bafaana ofiri nde. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Lo kundaa munde wuulu ka aasi esala o, lo si kana mu Nzaami wu aakasa ti nga-a-masumu akala wu bunsumu, Nzaami aakatala nde ti anga mbwuru wu bunsumu mu nkooro a kana li nde. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Me mu obo si, Dabvide ali mu okabili mu esee kii mbwuru, wuulu Nzaami aakakihi nde ti anga wu bunsumu gwene a otala bigyighili bi nde:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />«Esee kundaa babo ba oosi Nzaami bubi bu bo kolokolo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">ya ba aamaha nde masumu ma bo!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Esee kundaa mbwuru munde wuulu Mfumu ka aakatala masumu ma nde o<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1">Bik 32.1</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Esee ekye eli yini a kii ndaa baara ba básomo nzo a mbaa, bwunu we kii ba bagwene osomo si nzo a mbaa? Mu kuulu bihi lilyele ti: Kana li Abarahame lísi ti Nzaami atala nde ti anga mbwuru wu bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Mu nki matala Nzaami átala nde ti anga nde mbwuru wu bunsumu? Nsomo a nsomo, bwunu we ŋa mbihi a ŋa ásomo nzo a mbaa o? Pele, ka ŋa mbihi o, lo nsomo nde ásomo nzo a mbaa! <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Abrahame ágyagha elyimi kii osomo nzo a mbaa ti anga enyeme kii bunsumu bu ábagha nde mu kana, mu matala maala nde nkini ka áli asomo nzo a mbaa o. Mu obo, nde li taara a baara bwohono babo ba bali a kana wene a osomo nzo a mbaa, mu kuulu batala boho si ti anga baara baba bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Nde li si taara a ba básomo nzo a mbaa – ka oli yini a ba básomo nzo a mbaa o, lo ba baakadzyara mu bitaama bi kana li óli a Abarahame, taara a bihi, mu matala maala nde nkini áli ka ásomo nzo a mbaa o.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misiini mi Nzaami mi baakagyagha mu kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Mu obo, ka mu nzili a Mikyene Nzaami ásiini a Abarahame, bwunu we musyi a dzumu li nde, mu ogwolo pfa li nsie o, lo mu nzili a bunsumu bu kana. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Mu kuulu, kala ti ba baakagwolo pfa baakagwolo lo mu nzili a Mikyene, lo kana ka lifirisyili a mubwughu o ya misiini ka mifirisyili a mupfunu o. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Mu kuulu, Mikyene miikatubulu nkehe a Nzaami, ya ŋa ebini kiili Mikyene we, ka oli ya otsala ku Mikyene o.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Mu obo, me mu nkooro a kana baakagwolo pfa, mpaala bukala bwehe ya misiini mikala mimi bwohono ba bali mu musyi a dzumu li Abarahame. Ka yini a mu nkooro a babo ba baakasalala mikyene o, lo si mu nkooro a ba baakasa kana ti bu ósi Abarahame kana, taara a bihi bwohono, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />bwunu a bu básono ti: «Me aansi we taara a bikaana bilagha.» Nde li taara a bihi, ŋa nkulu a munde wu ási nde kana, Nzaami wu aakagwa bumweẽ kundaa baara ba bákpi ya wu aakasa ti bilogho biili ka bili o, bikala.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Nde ási emiini ŋaala ka bakughu osa emiini o, nde ási kana ya mu obo nde ayi taara a bikaana bilagha, ti bwunu a bu bályele ti: «Obo bu ookala musyi a dzumu li we.» <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Nde ka ányaã osa kana o, nde ámono nyuru a nde ti anga yo ayi yiikpi – ngu okala ti nde áli ku bele a bamvulu nkama (100) – ya mweẽ a Sara ka ali afirisyili a mbaa o. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Lo ŋa nkulu a misiini mi Nzaami, nde ka ási makeŋe o, mu ogwene osa kana, lo nde bu ábagha lileene mu kana ágwi masyighi kundaa Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Nde áli a kana lili mukughu ti, mi ookasiini a nde Nzaami, Nzaami li a lileene lii ogyighili mye. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Me mu obo bátala nde ti anga mbwuru wu bunsumu.<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Lo ka yini a mu nkooro a nde ngasighi básono o ti: «Me mu obo bátala nde ti mbwuru wu bunsumu,» <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />lo mu nkooro a bihi si, bihi baala kana li bihi sa batala lo, kundaa bihi ba liikasa kana mu munde wu ásiili Mfumu a bihi Yiisu ŋa kara li ba bákpi. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Yiisu, wu bátyeghe mu nkooro a bubi bu bihi ya básiili nde ŋa kara li ba bákpi mpaala bihi likala baara baba bunsumu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Edzuunu ya Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Me mu obo, bu lili baara baba bunsumu mu nkooro a kana, bihi-a-be lili mu edzuunu ya Nzaami mu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Me mu nde bihi liibagha nzili mu kana mu ogyagha bwehe bubo bu lili bihi munsa bo, ya bihi liisi mutwunu a bihi mu emiini kii nsia a Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ŋa yulu oŋo, bihi liikasa mutwunu mu mpara a bihi, bu lisoolo ti mpara yiikaburu nkaã, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />nkaã yiikasa ti mbwuru akebe mukihi wu alaba, ngu okala ti nde li kunsa bigyeele, okebe mukihi wu alaba ookagwa emiini. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Ankoho, emiini ka eekagwa bupfiri o, mu kuulu baagyirili dzyi li Nzaami mu mikolo mi bihi mu Mufulu a Ngili wu baagwi bihi.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Mu kuulu, ŋaala bihi áli nkini mpini we, Kriste ákpi mu nkooro a banga-a-masumu mu matala ma ókuru Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Oli mpara ti mbwuru akihi lipfu mu nkooro a mbwuru wu a nsumu, ampe mbwuru kughu obagha bukyini mu okpa mu nkooro a mbwuru wu mubwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Lo limono, bu oosuo Nzaami dzyi li nde mu bihi-a-be: Kriste ákpi mu nkooro a bihi-a-be ŋaala bihi-a-be áli nkini banga-a-masumu. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ya mu matala ma, maala bihi-a-be ayi lili baara baba bunsumu mu makili ma nde, oli ngaŋma ti Yiisu sa abvwuhu bihi-a-be mu nkehe a Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Mu kuulu, kala ti ŋa líli bihi-a-be mitaara mi Nzaami, Nde ábvurulu ogwihini o nde ya bihi-a-be mu lipfu li Mwana a nde, lo bunu bihi-a-be ligwene obvwughu mu bumweẽ bu mwana a nde, bu liibvurulu ogwihini ya nde. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ŋa yulu oŋo, bihi liikasa mutwunu a bihi mu Nzaami, mu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste. Mu nde bihi liigyagha obvurulu ogwihini mu matala ma.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adã ya Yiisu-Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Me mu obo, bwunu a bu oosomo lisumu mu nsie mu nzili a mbwuru mumõ, ya mu nzili a lisumu lipfu liisomo mu nsie, bwunu obo si lipfu liisomo mu baara bwohono, mu kuulu bwohono baasi masumu... <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Mu kuulu, tee mu matala ma oli Mikyene, masumu máli mu nsie, lo ka baakatala masumu o ŋaala Mikyene mye we. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Lo komo, obaana Adã tee Moyidze, lipfu líli a litumu, ngu okala ŋa yulu a ba bágwene osa masumu mu nzili a otsumunu ngili ti anga bu ósi Adã, nde wu li efaana ki munde wu faana ogya.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Lo ekaba kii bwehe ebvulu bubi bu ósi Adã mu mupfunu. Mu kuulu, kala ti mu bubi bu mbwuru mutsyini lipfu lísomo mu mampwumu ma baara, lo bwehe bu Nzaami ya ekaba kii bwehe ki bágwi mu bu mbwuru mutsyini, Yiisu-Kriste, épfini ku obvulu olagha ŋa yulu a mampwumu ma baara. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Lo ekaba ki ka eli bwunu a bu oli lisumu li mbwuru mutsyini o. Mu kuulu, mu nkooro a lisumu li mbwuru mutsyini mumfwunu áyafa mu masyeme, lo ekaba kii bwehe bu Nzaami mu nkooro a masumu ma malagha ekaba e bwehe égyi ya émaha masyeme. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Mu kuulu, kala ti mu nkooro a bubi bu mbwuru mutsyini lipfu líikatumu mu nde ngasighi, lo mu Yiisu-Kriste ngasighi bihi liibagha ku obvulu: Bwohono ba baakagyagha bwehe bu Nzaami ba bulagha ya ekaba kii bunsumu, sa bakala bumweẽ ya bakatumu yini a mu Yiisu-Kriste.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Me mu obo, buulu mu bubi bu mbwuru mutsyini masyeme mábwi mu baara bwohono, me obo si mu egyighili emõ kii bunsumu, ki ekughu osa mbwuru wu a bunsumu, égyi mu ogwa laama kundaa baara bwohono. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Mu kuulu, bwunu a bu óbwi mampwumu ma baara mu masumu mu nkyini a mbwuru mutsyini, bwunu obo si mu bintamana bi mbwuru mutsyini, sa basa mampwumu ma baara makala mama nsumu. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ankoho Mikyene mígyi mpaala bubi bupfini, lo ŋa ebini ki oopfini masumu, ŋaana-oŋo si bwehe buubvulu opfini. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Mpaala, bwunu a bu ookatumu masumu mu lipfu, bwunu obo si bwehe buukatumu mu bunsumu, mu laama lili mibvu ya mibvu mu Yiisu-Kriste, Mfumu a bihi.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bákpi mu masumu, lo bali mweẽ mu Yiisu-Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Bihi nki ndagha liilyele? Bihi lifaana okakala munsa masumu mpaala bwehe bupfini? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Si okala ka bunu! Buulu bihi-a-be lili ba bákpi mu masumu, bunu-abo likughu ofirilaama munsa masumu? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Be ka lisoolo o ti bihi-a-be bwohono báboghoro bihi mu okala emo mu Yiisu-Kriste? Mu obo, me mu okala emo mu lipfu li nde báboghoro bihi-a-be. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Mu liboghoro, baadzyighi bihi mu okala emõ ya nde mu lipfu li nde, mpaala bwunu a bu oosighili Kriste ŋa kara li ba bápki mu lileene li nsia a Taara, bwunu obo si bihi-a-be liikabuludzyara munsa bumweẽ bu bunyaghara. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Mu kuulu, kala ti Nzaami aasi bihi-a-be likala ti anga Yiisu mu lipfu li nde, nde sa asa kuulu ti bihi-a-be likala si ti anga Yiisu mu osighili o nde mu lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Bihi-a-be lifaana osoolo ti mbwuru wu mukulu wu áli mu bihi-a-be baakomo nde ŋa kuruwa ya Kriste, mpaala Nzaami amana mpini a nyuru yi masumu yi, ya bihi-a-be liinyaã ofirikala bankana ba masumu. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Mu kuulu, munde wu aakpi baakwulu nde mu masumu. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Ankoho kala ti bihi-a-be liipki emõ ya Kriste, bihi lisi kana ti bihi-a-be sa likala mweẽ ya nde, <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />bu lisoolo ti Kriste bu ásighili ŋa kara li ba bápki ka akala afirikpa o. Lipfu ka lifirisyili a litumu mu nde o. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Mu kuulu, kala ti nde aakpi, me mu nkooro a masumu ma baara nde aakpi sa limõ. Ya mu matala ma nde li mweẽ, nde li mweẽ mu nkooro a Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Bumo si mu be, be likala ti anga be liipki mu nkooro a masumu ya be likala mweẽ mu Yiisu-Kriste, mu nkooro a Nzaami.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Mu obo, masumu manyaã ofiritumu manyuru ma be ma maakakpa. Ka likala a bintamana mu okasa dzyi li manyuru ma be o. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ka ligwa manyuru ma be mu osalala masumu ti anga edzwana mu osalala bubi o. Lo be beme ligwa manyuru ma be kundaa Nzaami ti anga baara baba mweẽ ba basighili ŋa kara li ba bápki, ya lisa manyuru ma be makala ti anga edzwana mu osalala bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Mu kuulu, masumu ka mafirikala a litumu ŋa yulu a be o, mu kuulu be ka lili kunsa litumu li Mikyene o, lo kunsa litumu li bwehe.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osalala bunsumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Bihi nki ndagha liilyele? Likasa o bihi masumu mu kuulu ka lili kunsa litumu li Mikyene o, lo kunsa litumu li bwehe? Si okala ka bunu! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Be ka lisoolo o ti kala ti be likihi osalala mbwuru ti anga bankana, mu okala a bintamana mu nde, be ayi bankana ba mbwuru munde wu liikihi be bintamana osa? Bankana ba masumu ma maakabiri ku lipfu, bwunu we bankana ba bintamana bi biikabiri ku bunsumu? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Lo matuono kundaa Nzaami, ŋa mbihi a ŋa liili be bankana ba masumu, mu matala ma, be liisi bintamana mu mikolo mi be myehene mu maluo ma baagwi be. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Bu baakwulu be mu masumu, be ayi lili bankana ba bunsumu.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Me mu embwuru ndi mu okabili, bu nsoolo ti be ka liibakabaghala mandagha o: Mu kuulu, bwunu a bu lígwi be manyuru ma be mwohono kunsa bunkana mu osalala osuŋumu ya bubi, mu osini mu bubi bu bubvulu, bwunu obo si mu matala ma, litwulu manyuru ma be mwohono kunsa bunkana bu bunsumu mu osini mu laama li liikagwa Nzaami esee. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Mu kuulu, mu matala ma líli be bankana ba masumu, be líili bunya-nyaã ŋa nkulu a bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Nsa mufuru be líbagha mu matala mamo? Mandagha maala be lili a bupfiri mu mo lolo li, mu kuulu masini ma mo me lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Lo mu matala ma, bu baakwulu be mu masumu, be ayi bankana ba Nzaami, bimburu bi lili a be me laama li liikagwa Nzaami esee ya masini ma be me laama lili mibvu ya mibvu. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Mu kuulu mufuru a masumu li lipfu. Lo ekaba kii bwehe, ekaba e Nzaami me laama lili mibvu ya mibvu mu Yiisu-Kriste, Mfumu a bihi.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mukriste li wu bákwulu mu litumu li Mikyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, me kundaa baara ba basoolo Mikyene me ndi mu okabili. Be ka lisoolo o ti Mikyene mili a litumu ŋa yulu a mbwuru, mu matala mwohono ma ali nde mweẽ? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Mu obo, mukala li a munama ya mulumu a nde mu mikyene mi mabala mu matala mwohono maala mulumu a nde li mweẽ. Lo kala ti mulumu a nde kpi, mukaha ka afirisyili kunsa mikyene mi mabala mi miikabvughu nde munama ya mulumu a nde o. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Kala ti mu matala maala mulumu a nde li mweẽ, baghala mukimi firikie nde, baghala munde faana ofiri bukala mu kuulu nde aabvughu mbughu ya mukala a nganda-mbwuru. Lo kala ti mulumu a nde kpi, nde ka afirisyili kunsa Mikyene o. Mu obo, nde ka aabvughu mbughu ya mulumu a nganda-mbwuru o kala ti nde ayi mukala a baghala mukimi.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Mu obo, bandughu ba me mu kana, behe si bádzwi be mu mi mitala Mikyene mu kuulu be líili emo ya Kriste mu lipfu li nde. Mu bu, be lili baba ndaa mbwuru mukimi, munde wu áasighili ŋa kara li ba bápki, mu kuulu bihi-a-be likagyighili mandagha ma maakagwa Nzaami esee. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Mu kuulu, mu matala ma líli bihi-a-be kunsa litumu li musunu, bihi-a-be líili a dzyi li okasa masumu mu nzili a mikyene, ya dzyi lilo, líkasala mu manyuru ma bihi mwohono. Ya bihi-a-be líikasa mandagha ma maakabiri ku lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Lo mu matala ma, bihi-a-be ka lifirisyili kunsa litumu li Mikyene o. Ngu okala ti bihi-a-be lili bankana, ka mu litumu li likulu, lili Mikyene mi basono o. Lo bihi-a-be lili bankana mu litumu li linyaghara lili Mufulu Ngili.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esala ki Mikyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Opa 20.17; Det. 5.21</char>
    </note> Bihi nki ndagha liilyele? Mikyene mili masumu? Si okala ka bunu! Lo yini a mu nzili a Mikyene me aansoolo masumu. Mu obo, me ka ákaansoolo sughu li mukolo o, kala ti Mikyene ka míkalyele o ti: «We ka sughu mukolo o.» <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Mu obo, masumu bu mabagha mpeene, maaburu mu me mu nzili a mukyene, sughu li mukolo lili mawa-mawa. Mu kuulu, wene a Mikyene, masumu maakpi. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Mu matala ma makulu, me áandi mweẽ wene a Mikyene. Lo mikele bu migyi, masumu mabagha bumweẽ, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />ya me, me aankpi. Mu obo, mukele wu aakabiri ku laama, aatsiini me ku lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Mu kuulu, mu mikele, masumu maabagha mpeene yi opfiri me, ya mu mye, masumu maadzwi me. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Obo me buulu, Mikyene mili mimi ngili ya mikele mili mimi ngili, mimi nsumu ya mi mibwe.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Mu obo, kundaa me bubwe ayi lipfu? Si okala ka bunu! Obo me bu oosuo lisumu maangu-efa e lo, lo liisalala bubwe mu obiri me mu lipfu. Mpaala mu mukele, lisumu limoŋono mu lileene li lo lwohono.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkana a mukyene a lisumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Mu kuulu, bihi-a-be lisoolo ti Mikyene mili mufulu. Lo me, me ndi mbwuru wu li a nyuru yi musunu, wu bátyeghe kundaa masumu. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Mu kuulu, me ka ndi mu okabaghala mandagha ma ndi mu ogyighili me o. Ndagha yi ndzyi me, me ka ndi mu okagyighili yo o. Lo yi aangwene okadzyi me, me yi ndi mu okagyighili me. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Lo kala ti ndagha yi aakangyighili me ngu yi aangwene okadzyi me, me ndi bitsimi bimõ ya mikyene, mu olyele ti mye mili mi mibwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Mu matala ma, ka ofirisyili me meme ndi mu okagyighili mandagha mamo o, me lisumu li lili mu me li li mu okatumu me mo okagyighili.<verse eid="ROM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Me nsoolo yo ti mu me ka oli a ndagha yimbwe o, ma mbaala ti munsa nyuru a me. Mu kuulu mu me, me nkughu okala a bitsimi bii osa bubwe, lo me ka ndi a mpini mu osa bo o. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Me ka aakansa bubwe bu aakandzyi me o, lo me aakansa bubi bu aangwene okadzyi me. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Kala ti me ngyighili ndagha yiili me ka ndzyi yo o, ka me ndi mu ofirikagyighili yo o, lo lisumu li lili mu me lili mu okagyighili yo. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Mu obo, me wu ndzyi osa bubwe me aabaghala mukyene wu: Ndagha yi nkughu me osa yina bubi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Mu kuulu, munsa mukolo a me, me aankamono esee mu Mikyene mi Nzaami, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />lo munsa nyuru a me yohono me aakamono mukyene mukimi wu aakadzwana ya munde wu li emo ya mayele ma me. Nde aakasa me nkana a mukyene a lisumu li lili mu nyuru a me. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nyiĩ mu me! Nande akala aakwulu me mu nyuru yi, yi aakabiri me ku lipfu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Matuono kundaa Nzaami mu Yiisu-Kriste Mfumu a bihi-a-be!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Me mu obo, mu embwuru e me, me ndi nkana a Mikyene mi Nzaami, lo mu nyuru a me, me ndi nkana a mikyene mi lisumu.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bumweẽ bwunu a bu oli Mufulu a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Obo me buulu, mu matala ma, ka ofirisyili a masyeme kundaa ba bali mu Yiisu-Kriste o. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Mu kuulu, mikyene mi Mufulu mi miikagwa laama mu Yiisu-Kriste miikwulu we mu mikyene mi lisumu ya mimi lipfu.<verse eid="ROM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Mu kuulu Nzaami bu agweghe Mwana a ndeme mu efafaana kii nyuru yi embwuru, mu nkooro a masumu, nde aasyeme masumu mu nyuru a mwana a nde. Mikyene ka mikughu ogyighili obo o, mu kuulu nyuru yiimana nde mpini. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Mu kuulu bunsumu bu ookaluomo Mikyene bukughu mu bihi-a-be ba liigwene okadzyara mu embwuru, lo mu Mufulu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Mu obo, babo ba bali kunsa litumu lili embwuru bali a bitsimi bimõ ya bu ookadzyi nyuru, lo babo ba bali kunsa litumu li Mufulu, bali a bitsimi bimõ ya bu ookadzyi Mufulu. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Ankoho dzyi li nyuru liikabiri ku lipfu, dzyi li Mufulu, liikabiri ku laama ya ku edzuunu. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Mu kuulu dzyi li nyuru liikabiri mbwuru mu okala mutaara a Nzaami, nde ka ali kunsa litumu li Mikyene mi Nzaami o, nde ka kughu si onama mye o. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Babo ba bali kunsa litumu li dzyi li nyuru, ka bakughu ogwa Nzaami esee o.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Lo kundaa be, be ka lili kunsa litumu li dzyi li nyuru o, lo be lili kunsa litumu li Mufulu, kala oli ngaŋma ti Mufulu a Nzaami aakakala mu be. Ya kala ti mbwuru ka li a Mufulu a Kriste o, lo nde ka li wu a ndaa Kriste o. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ankoho kala ti Kriste li mu be, mu engaŋma nyuru a be yiikpi mu nkooro a masumu, lo Mufulu li bumweẽ mu nkooro a bunsumu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ya kala ti Mufulu a munde wu aasiili Yiisu ŋa kara li ba bákpi li mu be, munde wu aasiili Kriste ŋa kara li ba bápki sa akala agwa si laama kundaa manyuru ma be ma maakakpa mu Mufulu a nde wu li mu be.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Me mu obo, bandughu ba me mu kana, bihi-a-be lili a ebyimi, lo ka kundaa nyuru yi embwuru o mu okala mweẽ ti bu oli dzyi li nyuru. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Mu kuulu, kala ti be liikanama nzya-nzyara a nyuru, be sa likpa. Lo kala ti mu Mufulu, be lidzwi bigyighili bi nyuru, be sa lilaama. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Mu kuulu, baara bwohono ba baakadzyara kunsa Mufulu a Nzaami bali baana ba Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Be ka lígyagha mufulu wu bunkana o, mufulu wu aafirikagwa be nzalamweẽ. Lo be líigyagha Mufulu mumõ wu aakakirili bihi nkara a baana ba Nzaami, mu nde bihi-a-be liikakehe engubu ti: «Aba!» Mbaala ti, «Taara!» <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Mufulu ndeme li mu okasuo bumpughulu kundaa mufulu a bihi ti bihi-a-be lili baana ba Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ankoho, kala ti bihi-a-be lili baana, bihi-a-be lili si ba baakasyili a pfa: Ba baasyili a pfa li Nzaami, ba baasyili a pfa emõ ya Kriste, kala oli ngaŋma ti bihi-a-be liikamono mpara ya nde mu obagha nsia emõ ya nde.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsia yi aagya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Mu obo me ntsimi ti, mpara yi matala mama lolo ka yikughu okala embehe ya nsia yi akala aamoŋono mu bihi-a-be o. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Mu kuulu byehene bi ógyighili Nzaami bili mu okakebe ya mukolo mbaa, omoŋono o nsia a baana ba Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Mu kuulu, byehene bi ógyighili Nzaami bili kunsa litumu li mandagha ma magwene a mupfunu, ka mu dzyi li byeme o lo mu nkooro a munde wu aasi bye kunsa litumu li nde, ya emiini: <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Sa bakwulu bye mu bunkana ya mu lileene li liikabyihi bye, mpaala bye bikala munsa bunya-nyaã ya kunsa nsia a baana ba Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ankoho bihi-a-be lisoolo ti, tee mu matala ma, nsie yohono yili mu okasyama ya yili mu okamono mpara a misuo mi oburu. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Bihi-a-be si ba lili a bimburu bi Mufulu bibi nsomo, bihi-a-be si liikasyama kunsa mikolo mi bihi-a-be, bu liikakebe matala ma oosa bihi Nzaami maa ngu baana ba nde, ya ma baakwulu manyuru ma bihi-a-be. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Mu kuulu, me munsa emiini baabvwuhu bihi-a-be. Lo ankoho, emiini ki liikamono ka eefirikasyili emiini o: Elogho ki baakamono, bakughu ofirisa emiini mu kye? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Lo kala ti bihi-a-be liikasa emiini mu elogho ki liigwene okamono, bihi-a-be liikakebe kye ya mukama.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Bumõ si, Mufulu akayabaha bihi ba liikagwene a makpa, mu kuulu bihi ka liikasoolo mandagha ma lifaana oluomo mu nsamana a bihi o. Lo Mufulu ndeme aakasamana mu bihi, mu misyama miili ka bakughu obagha bu baalyele mye o. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ya munde wu aakagyighili okehene mikolo soolo bitsimi bi Mufulu. Nde aakasamana mu baba ngili ti bwunu a bu ookadzyi Nzaami.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Bihi lisoolo si ti mandagha mwohono maakasala mu bubwe bu babo ba baakadzyi Nzaami, babo ba áti nde mbili ti bwunu a bu oli bitsimi bi ákuru nde. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Mu kuulu, babo ba átswama osuolo nde, nde átswama ogwolo si munkaana wu osa bo bakala embehe ya efaana e Mwana a nde, mpaala nde akala mwana wu a nsomo ŋa kara li mpwumu a baana ba taara. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ya babo ba átswama osuolo nde, nde áti boho si mbili. Babo ba áti nde mbili, nde ási boho si baba bunsumu, ya babo ba ási nde baba bunsumu, nde ágwi boho si nsia.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunene bu dzyi li Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Mu obo, nki ndagha bihi liifirilyele mu ndagha oyo? Kala ti Nzaami li ku engulu kii ndaa bihi, nande aakala mutaara a bihi? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Nde wu aatyeghe Mwana a ndeme mu nkooro a bihi bwohono, bunu-abo, mu nzili a bwehe, akughu ogwene ogwa bihi si byehene emõ ya Mwana a nde? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nande akala aafwunu babo ba ósuolo Nzaami? Me Nzaami aakasa ti baara bakala baba bunsumu! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nande aagwa bo ebili? Me Yiisu-Kriste aakpi! Ŋa yulu oŋo, nde aasighili mu lipfu, nde li ŋa kwogho-a-kwogho e Nzaami ya aakasamana mu okala bihi-a-be! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nande aakabala bihi-a-be ya dzyi li Kriste? Nyiĩ, minyoõ, kimini, nzala, mpene, nsihi, bwunu we lipfu? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Bwunu a bu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Mu nkooro a we, bali mu okadzwa bihi nswe etsughu.»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Bali mu okagwolo bihi ti anga bindoomo bi baakehe mabolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bik 44.23.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Lo mu mandagha mwohono mamo, bihi lili ba babvulu olughulu mu munde wu aadzyi bihi. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Mu kuulu me ndi a emiini ti, ngu okala lipfu, ngu okala bumweẽ, ngu okala bangye-yulu, ngu okala bimpu, ngu okala mandagha mama lolo li, ngu okala mandagha mama bitsughu bibi nkulu, ngu okala banga a lileene, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ngu okala mpini yili mu yulu, ngu okala mpini yili mu nsie, ngu okala elogho ekimi ki bágyighili ka ekughu okabala bihi ya dzyi li Nzaami mu Yiisu-Kriste, Mfumu a bihi o.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nzaami ya ekaana ki aasuolo nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Me ndyele engaŋma mu Kriste, me ka mpfiri mpya o, embwuru e me eli mu okasuo bumpughulu bu me mu Mufulu a ngili: <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Me ndi a nyiĩ yi alagha ya mukolo a me li munsa mpara matala mwohono. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Mu kuulu, me ndzyi ti me meme mbagha ndogho ŋa nkulu a Nzaami, ya me nkala o me wu áakaghaba ya Kriste mu nkooro a baana ba taara a me, ba bali ekaana emõ ya me. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Bo ba bali basi Isarayele, Nzaami ási bo nkara a baana ba nde, nde ágwi bo nsia, bindughu, Mikyene, esala kii okabuono, misiini, <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />bankagha-kwuru, ya me mu bo Kriste ágyi mu nyuru yi musunu, nde wu li ŋa yulu a byehene, Nzaami wu baakasyighi mu mibvu ya mibvu. «Aamene!»<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Me ka ndyele o ti ndagha a Nzaami ka yiisyili a mpini o. Mu kuulu, bwohono ba bápala mu dzumu li Isarayele ka bali basi Isarayele o. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Nkara a baana ba Abarahame, ka oli bwohono ba bali mu musyi a dzumu li nde o, lo: «Me mu Idzake we akala aabagha babo ba baata ti musyi a dzumu li we.» <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Mbaala ti, ka oli baana baba musunu bali baana ba Nzaami o, lo baana baba misiini baakatala bo ti musyi a dzumu li nde. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Mu kuulu, ndagha yi bágwi misiini me yi: «Mu ena kyini a kiki, me sa yambvughuru ya Sara sa aburu mwana wu baghala.»<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ya ka oli yini a ndagha oyo o, óli obo si mu Rebeka, wu áabagha yimi mu baghala mumõ, Idzake, taara a bihi. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Mu kuulu, baana babo nkini áli ka báburu bo o, ya bo nkini áli ka bágyighili bubwe bwunu we bubi o, lo, mu kuulu bitsimi bi ótswama okuru Nzaami bikakala bwunu a bu ásuolo nde, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />ka mu nkooro a bigyighili o, lo mu munde wu aakata mbili, bályele kundaa Rebeka ti: «Naana sa akala musala a mbwee,»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eba 25.23.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />bwunu a bu básono ti: «Me aansuolo Dzakobe ya aantwulu Edzawu mu libee.»<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Mu obo, emakye liilyele? Mu Nzaami oli a ogwene a bunsumu? Si okala ka bunu! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Mu kuulu nde ályele kundaa Moyidze ti: «Me sa mono nyiĩ a munde wu ndzyi me omono nyiĩ, ya me sa mono ngebe a munde wu ndzyi me omono ngebe.» <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Me mu obo, mimye ka mili mu waa li wu dzyi o, bwunu we mu lili wu li mu okabara ntyini, lo mu lili Nzaami wu aakamono nyiĩ. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Mu kuulu Bisono biikalyele kundaa Faraõ ti: «Mu mpere me aambyaha we mukogho mu osuo mu we lileene li me ya mu kuulu batsala nsia a nkwumu a me mu nsie nsyini.» <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Me mu obo, nde aakamono nyiĩ kundaa munde wu adzyi nde omono nyiĩ, ya aakagwa mukolo ngyi kundaa munde wu adzyi nde ogwa mukolo ngyi.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkehe ya ngebe a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Mu obo, we sa lyele ti bunu-abo Nzaami akughu ofirikasyeme? Mu kuulu, nande kughu obihi waa li nde? <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Lo we mbwuru, we nande li, mu osa mikeme ya Nzaami? «Elogho ki baamyene ekughu olyele kundaa wu aamyene kye ti: Mu emakye we aamyene me bu?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mbwuru wu aakamyene bilogho mu mubweẽ ka li a litumu mu mubweẽ o? Mu nkpaŋa a mubweẽ gyini oyo nde ka kughu ogyighili elogho ki baakasalala mu budziri, ya elogho ki baakasalala wene a budziri o? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ya kala ti Nzaami bu adzyi osuo nkehe a nde ya osa ti bagyahaba lileene li nde, aakuru mukolo ya aakebe ku olagha bilogho bibi nkehe bi bágyighili mu nkooro a opfighili, <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />mpaala nde asa kuulu ti bagyahaba busini bu nsia a nde kundaa bilogho bibi ngebe bi átswama ogyighili nde mu nkooro a nsia a nde. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ya baara babo ngu bihi-a-be. Nde áti bihi-a-be mbili, ka oli yini a ŋa kara li ba-Dzwife o, lo si ŋa kara li baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />ti bwunu a bu ólyele Nzaami mu mukaana a mubighili Odze ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">«Wuulu ka áli ekaana e me o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">me sa nta nde ekaana e me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">ya wuulu ka áli wu a nkwunu o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">me sa nta nde wu a nkwunu,<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />ya ŋa ebini kyini ekye ŋa áli balyele bo ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“Be ka lili ekaana e me o”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">sa bata bo ti baana ba Nzaami wu a mweẽ.»<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Mubighili Edzayi ku ngulu yi a nde ákehe engubu mu nkooro a Isarayele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">«Ngu okala ti mutala a baana ba Isarayele ayi ti anga dzyele li mubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">yini a mana ndaama yi aasyili akala yiibvwughu,<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />mu kuulu, Mfumu sa agyighili kuu mukughu ya mu maswa-maswa ndagha a nde ŋa nsie.»<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ya, bwunu a bu ootswama olyele Edzayi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">«Kala ti Mfumu Sabaote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mfumu Sabaote </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbaala ti, Mfumu Nga-a-Mampwumu.</char></note> ka ásihi bihi musyi a dzumu o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">bihi lìikapfighili ti anga bvulu lili Sodome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">bihi lìikaafaana a bvulu lili Ngomore.»<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isarayele ya obvwughu mu kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Mu obo, emakye bihi liilyele? Baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, baala ka bákasagha bunsumu ŋa nkulu a Nzaami o, baabagha bunsumu, bunsumu bu baakabagha mu kana <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />lo Isarayele wu áakanama Mikyene mimi bunsumu, aakuono okuhu Mikyene mimye. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Mu emakye? Mu kuulu nde aakanama bunsumu bubo, ka mu kana o, lo ti anga bu buukafa mu bigyighili. Bo baakubu kya mu limeẽ li baakakubu makya, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />bwunu a bu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Me ntwulu mu mu bvulu lili Siyõ limeẽ li baakakubu makya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">limeẽ li linene li liikabwihi makubu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ya munde wu aasa kana mu nde, ka akala aakpa budzwa o.»<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, ndagha yi mvulu ndzyi me, ya lisamana li me kundaa Nzaami me liili ti ba-Dzwife babvwughu. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Mu kuulu me aakansuo bumpughulu mu bo ti bo bali a mukolo wu áalwulu mu mbaa a dzyi mu Nzaami, lo mbaa a dzyi li bo ka yili kunsa otsyeme ku ligyahaba o. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Mu kuulu, bo bu bagwene obaghala bu ookasa Nzaami baara bunsumu, ya bu baakasagha okala baara baba bunsumu mu ebomo, mu obo bo ka bali mu okasa bintamana mu ma ookasa Nzaami mu otwulu baara bunsumu, <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />mu kuulu, Kriste ákuhu Mikyene, mpaala bwohono ba baakasa kana, Nzaami asa bo bunsumu ŋa nkulu a nde.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagha, kana ya obvwughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mu kuulu, Moyidze ásono mu mi mitala bunsumu bu buukafa mu Mikyene ti: «Mbwuru wu akala aasa mandagha ma sa akala mweẽ mu mo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lbv 18.5.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Lo ligyughu bu ookalyele Ndagha a Nzaami mu mi mitala bunsumu bu ookagwa kana: «Ka lyele mu mukolo a we o ti: Nande akala aakumu ku yulu?» Mbaala ti, mu osurulu Kriste ŋa nsie. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Bwunu we ti: «Nande akala aakumunu ku nsini a mbie yi nda yi a laŋa-laŋa?» Mbaala ti, mu opaha Kriste ŋa kara li ba bákpi. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Mu obo, ndagha oyo bunu yidzyi olyele? «Ndagha yili ŋa bele a we, mu muŋma a we ya mu mukolo a we» Ndagha oyo me ndagha yi a kana yi liikatsala bihi nsia. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Mu kuulu, kala ti mu muŋma a we, we kihi ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono ti Yiisu me Mfumu, ya kala ti mu mukolo a we, we si kana ti Nzaami ásiili nde ŋa kara li ba bákpi, we sa bvwughu. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Mu kuulu, me mu mukolo baakasa kana; li liikasa ti Nzaami asa mbwuru akala wu bunsumu, ya me mu muŋma baakakihi ndagha yi aakabiri ku obvwughu. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Mu kuulu, Bisono biikalyele ti: Nswe munde «wu aasa kana mu nde ka akala aakpa budzwa o<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edz 28.16, ti bu básono mu mukaana wu mukulu mu engereke.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Mu obo, ka oli a lisobo ŋa kara li mu-Dzwife ya mu-Ngereke o: Bo bwohono bali a Mfumu mumõ, wuli esini kundaa babo bwohono ba baakasamana nde. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Mu kuulu, «nswe munde wu aasamana nkwumu a Mfumu, sa abvwughu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dzo 3.5.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Mu obo, bunu-abo bo baasamana nkwumu a munde wuulu bo ka baasi kana mu nde o? Ya bunu-abo bo baasa kana mu munde wuulu bo ka baagyughu bu baatsala nsia a nde o? Ya bo bunu-abo baagyughu kala ti ka oli a mbwuru wu aatsala nsia nde o? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Ya bunu-abo bo baatsala nsia a nde kala ti ka bagweghe baara mu oyitsala yo o? Ti bwunu a bu básono ti: «Limono bu mili mye mibwe, myili mi babo ba baakabulutuoho mansia ma mabwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edz 52.7.</char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Lo bo bwohono ka baasi bintamana mu nsia yi mbwe o. Mu kuulu Edzayi ályele ti: «Mfumu, nande aasi kana mu mandagha ma baagyughu bo kundaa bihi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edz 53.1, ti bu básono mu mukaana wu mukulu mu engereke.</char></note>?» <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Mu obo, kana liikafa mu mandagha ma baakagyughu, ya mandagha ma baakagyughu maakafa mu ndagha a Kriste. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Lo me mfwulu ti: Bo ka baagyughu o? Bo baagyughu! Mu kuulu Bisono biikalyele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«Baagyughu likyi li bo mu nsie nsyini,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«ya baagyughu mandagha ma bo tee ku manto ma nsie mu oli baara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bik 19.5, ti bu básono mu mukaana wu mukulu mu engereke.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Lo me mfwulu ti: Isarayele ka aasoolo ndagha oyo o? Moyidze ngu wu a nsomo mu olyele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«Me sa nsa kuulu be lisa ebaa ekaana kiili ka eli ekaana o,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«mu nzili a ekaana ki egwene a mayele, me sa ntsubu nkehe a be<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Det 32.21.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Ya Edzayi ási bukyini tee mu olyele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Bámono me kundaa babo baala ka bákasagha me o,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«me áamoŋono kundaa babo baala ka báfwulu me ndagha o<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edz 65.1, ti bu básono mu mukaana wu mukulu mu engereke.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Lo mu mi mitala Isarayele, nde ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«Matala mwohono, me aandabala myaã mi me kundaa ekaana»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«ki ébihi osa bintamana ya ki eli a mutswi mpini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edz 65.2, ti bu básono mu mukaana wu mukulu mu engereke.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nzaami ka átsili ekaana e nde o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Me mu obo me mfwulu ti: Bunu, Nzaami aatsili ekaana e nde? Si okala ka bunu! Mu kuulu, meme ndi musi Isarayele, wu a musyi a dzumu li Abarahame, mu dzumu li Benzamẽ. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />«Nzaami ka aatsili ekaana e nde o,» ekaana ki átswama osoolo nde. Be ligyighili osoolo mi ookalyele Bisono, mu matala ma ókanyoõ mubighili Eli kundaa Nzaami mu nkooro a basi Isarayele ti: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Mfumu, «bo baadzwi mibighili mi we, bo baatsala bibini bi we bi baakagwa bikaba. Yini a me ngasighi aansyili ya bo badzyi odzwa me!» <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Lo mvuru a Nzaami nki yo? «Mu nkooro a meme, me aambunu mapfwunu nsaama (7 000) ma baara baala ka baakasamana nzaami a Baale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nzaami a Baale </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nzaami a basi Fenisi ya basi Kaana. Bo bákatehebe nde nsumu ya Nzaami a Isarayele.</char></note> o<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Mik 19.18.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Bumõ si mu matala mama lolo, oli a ndaama a baara baba bunsumu ba baasyili, ti bwunu a bu oli munsuolo wu a bwehe bu Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ankoho, kala ti mu nkooro a bwehe, lo ka ofirisyili mu nkooro a bigyighili o. Kala pele, bwehe ka bufirisyili bwehe o.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Mu obo, emakye bihi liilyele? Bilogho bi ookasagha Isarayele, bo ka baabagha bye o. Yini babo ba ósuolo Nzaami baabagha bye. Baara babake ayi ya mikolo ngyi, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />ti bwunu a bu ookalyele Bisono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">«Tee mu etsughu kii lolo,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">«Nzaami aagwi bo mufulu wu ogwuu,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">«aadzwi bo mihi mpaala banyaã omono,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">«aakyihi bo matswi mpaala banyaã ogyughu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Det 29.3.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Ya mukogho Dabvide si ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«Nyaã byiri bi bo bii odza bikala mwere kundaa bo, musyi a mbyi,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«nzili yi obwa, masyeme ma mafaana!»<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />«Nyaã mihi mi bo mikala kunsa mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa mpaala banyaã omono elogho nga-emõ!»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">«Sa kuulu ti bibughu bibo bikala bibi korono matala mwohono<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:23-24">Bik 69.23-24</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba-Dzwife ya baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o mu bitsimi bi ókuru Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Mu obo, me mfwulu ti: Bo bu baatsahana, mpaala babwa kuulu ofiritemene we? Si okala ka bunu! Lo mu nkooro a bubi bu bo, baagwi obvwughu kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, mu otsubu ebaa ki Isarayele. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ankoho, bubi bu ba-Dzwife buusi ti nsie yibagha busini, ya obwa o bo oosi ti baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o babagha busini. Lo nki busini buukala mu matala ma akala baasighili bo kuu mukughu?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Me ndyele kundaa be baala ka lili ba-Dzwife o, buulu me ndi ntumu a baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, me ndi a esee mu esala e me. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Obo me buulu me nkughu otsubu ebaa ŋa kara li ba lili a bo dzumu li mõ, ya obvwuhu ndaama a baara babake. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Mu kuulu, kala ti otwulu o bo mu libee oosi ti Nzaami abvurulu ogwihini ya nsie, lo ŋa oofirigyagha bo Nzaami bunu a bo ookala? Bo sa babagha bumweẽ lo ka lipfu o. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ankoho kala ti kaba lili nsomo mu nkpaŋa a limpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kaba lili nsomo mu nkpaŋa a limpa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Mikyene mi Moyise, bágwi litumu ti kaba lili nsomo mu byehene lili Nzaami. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 23:10">Bun 23.10</ref></char>.</note> lili lili ngili, nkpaŋa yohono yili si yi a ngili. Ya kala ti mudza li wu a ngili, mampala mali si mama ngili.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Lo kala ti bagwahala ndaama a mampala ma muti a mu-Olibve mamake, ya kala ti we wu li musumunu mu-Olibve wu musuru, kala ti baanahaba we mu muti munde, ya mu matala ma kala ti we li a kaba mu malyimi ma maakafa mu mudza a mu-Olibve munde, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />lo we ka sa mutwunu o. Kala ti we si mutwunu, ka dzimini o ti ka we aakwara mudza o, lo mudza aakwara we. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Mu obo we sa bvuhulu ti: Kala ti baagwahala mampala, me mu kuulu banahaba me ŋa ebini ekye. <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ndagha oyo yi a ngaŋma, mampala mamo baagwahala mo mu kuulu mo magwene a kana. Lo we, we li ŋa ebini e mo mu nkooro a kana. Ka kala a mubili a nyuru mu ndagha oyo o, lo kala a nzalamweẽ. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Mu kuulu, kala ti Nzaami aatwulu mu libee mampala ma mámene momo mu muti, we sa mayele mpaala nde anyaã otwulu wehe si mu libee.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Mu obo, mono ati bubwe ya ebaghala e Nzaami, nde li a ebaghala kundaa ba baabwi, ya nde sa asa bubwe kundaa we kala ti, we nabara mu bubwe bu nde. Kala pele, wehe si sa bagwahala we. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Bumõ si kundaa bomo ba-Dzwife, kala ti bo babihi osa kana, sa banahaba bo mu muti. Mu kuulu Nzaami li a lileene lili ofirinahaba bo mu muti. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Mu kuulu, kala ti batebe we mu mu-Olibve wu musuru, mu olyele ti we li musumunu wu baanahaba mu mu-Olibve wu bákunu. Mu obo, sa obvulu okala bubwe ti banahaba ba-Dzwife mu mu-Olibve wu a ndaa-bomo, ti bwunu a bu oli efa e bo.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvwughu o Isarayele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Mu kuulu, bandughu ba me mu kana, me ka ndzyi o ti be likala kunsa nzi-nzimini a mansweghe ma Nzaami ma maamoŋono ma, mpaala be linyaã omoŋono ti anga baara ba babvulu mayele ŋa mihi mi beme. Ndaama a baara mu Isarayele ayi ya mukolo ngyi, tee mu matala ma osomo bwohono baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ya me obo ekaana e Isarayele kyehene akala eebvwughu, ti bwunu a bu ookalyele Bisono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">«Mukwulu sa afa ku munguo wu a Siyõ,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">«nde sa amaha mandagha ma mabi mu Dzakobe.»<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />«Ya obo akala me bu ookala ogwihini o me ya bo,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">«mu matala ma akala aamaha me masumu ma bo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">Edz 27.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Dze 31.33-34</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Mu mi mitala Nsia yi Mbwe, ngaŋma, ba-Dzwife bali mitaara mu nkooro a be. Lo mu mi mitala munsuolo a Nzaami, bo bali ba odzyi Nzaami mu nkooro a bataara ba bo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Mu kuulu, bikaba bibi bwehe ya mbili a Nzaami mu esala ka baafirikagwolo ya baafirikasobo bye o. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Mu kuulu, ti bwunu a bu líbihi be osa bintamana mu Nzaami mu nsi-nkulu, ya mu matala ma, Nzaami aamono be nyiĩ mu nkooro a nkyini a bo. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Bwunu obo boho si mu matala ma, ba-Dzwife baasi nkyini, mpaala bamono boho si ngebe, ti bu baamono be ngebe. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Mu kuulu, Nzaami ákuru baara bwohono kunsa ekogholo kii nkyini mpaala amono bo bwohono ngebe.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Wo! Busini, bunsughu ya ligyahaba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">bi Nzaami bili mugyighi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Ka bakughu osoolo mandagha ma aakalamana nde o!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Ya manzili ma nde ka bakughu obaghala mo o!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Mu kuulu, «nande aasoolo bitsimi bi Mfumu?»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">«Nande aali mumpa-luo a nde?»<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />«Nande aagwi Mfumu nsomo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">mpaala Mfumu afiri nde?»<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Byehene bífi kundaa nde, bágyighili bye kundaa nde ya mu nkooro a nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Nyaã nsia yikala yi a nde mu mibvu ya mibvu! «Aamene!»<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Bumweẽ bu bunyaghara mu Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Me mu obo, bandughu ba me mu kana, mu nyiĩ a Nzaami yi alagha, me ngwi be mpama, mu ogwa manyuru ma be ti anga mikaba mimi mweẽ, mimi ngili ya mi ookadzyi Nzaami. Kundaa be, obo sa okala obuono Nzaami ku ofaana ya Ndagha a nde. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ka likanama bipfu bi baara ba nsie yi o, lo likala baara baala bu likighiri, libagha mayele ma manyaghara, mpaala be libaghala waa li Nzaami: Mandagha ma mabwe, ma aakakihi nde ya mama mukughu.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Mu bwehe bu oogwi me Nzaami, me ndyele kundaa nswe mbwuru mu be anyaã okala a bitsimi bii obvulu osagha omoŋono. Lo nswe mbwuru faana osagha okala a nzya-nzyara yi mayele ti bwunu a bu oli eteese ki ekaba li kana li ógwi nde Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Mu kuulu, bwunu a bu oli binama bilagha mu nyuru a bihi, nyuru yili nga-mõ, ya binama byehene bibi nyuru ka biikasala esala emõ o, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />mu obo, bihi-a-be ba lili balagha, lili nyuru mõ mu Kriste, ya nswe mbwuru mu bihi-a-be li enama ki e wu muke mu nyuru nga-mõ oyo. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Lo bihi-a-be lili a bikaba bibi ya lisobo bibi bwehe, ti bu oli bwehe bu ógwi bihi-a-be Nzaami. Kala ti mbwuru li a ekaba kii mubighili, lo asalala kye bwunu a bu oli bunsumu bu kana. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Kala ti mbwuru li a ekaba kii osalala, lo agwa nyuru a nde mu esala ekye. Nyaã munde wu aakaluo, agwa nyuru a nde mu maluo. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Munde wu li a ekaba ki ogwa bana mpama, akagwa mpama. Munde wu li a ekaba ki okaba, akakaba mu mukolo mumõ, munde wu li a ekaba ki otumu, akatumu ya mbaa, mbwuru nga-a-nyiĩ akamono nyiĩ mu esee.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Nyaã dzyi likala lili ngaŋma. Liikabele mandagha ma mabi, liikanabara mu mandagha ma mabwe. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Mu mi mitala dzyi lili bandughu mu kana, liikakala a dzyi be a be. Liikakala ba bansomo mu okagwa banganda budziri. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ka likakala a bubolo o, lo liikakala a mbaa mu esala. Liikakala a mbaa mu mufulu, liikasalala Mfumu ti anga basala ba babwe. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Liikakala a esee mu emiini. Liikakala a nkaã munsa mpaara. Liikasa mukama mu obuono. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Liikabaha ba bangili mu okagwa bo bi bali a bo nzala a bye. Liikabwana bandzyi.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Liikaseme ba baakamwehẽ be kimini, liikaseme ya ka likabiili mpwoho o.<verse eid="ROM 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Liikakala mu esee ya babo ba bali mu esee. Liikalili ya babo ba baakalili. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ligyighili okagwihini be a be. Ka likakala a mubili a nyuru o, lo liikasagha okala emõ ya baara ba bakughulu ya okasa mikolo mu bisala bi bikughulu. Ka likatsimi o ti be libvulu bunsughu.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ka likabvurulu bubi mu bubi kundaa mbwuru o. Liikasa mpini mu okagyighili mandagha ma mabwe ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Kala ti bukughu okala, ya kala mitala be, liikakala mu edzuunu ya baara bwohono. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Bandughu ba me baba mukolo, ka likabvurulu bubi mu bubi o, lo liikanyaã nkehe a Nzaami yikagwa mvuru, mu kuulu básono ti: «Me aambvurulu etere», me akala «aangwa mufuru<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Bun 19.18</ref></char></note>», obo me bu olyele Mfumu. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Lo «kala ti mutaara a we li a nzala, gwa nde bi-odza. Kala ti nde li a nyoro, gwa nde madza. Mu kuulu, we sa obo, we li mu okakwu makala ma mbaa ŋa yulu a mutswi a nde<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Man 25.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 6:22">2 Mik 6.22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat 5.44</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:35">25.35</ref></char></note>». <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ka nyaã bubi bulughulu ŋa nkulu a we o, lo we lughulu ŋa nkulu a bubi mu okagyighili mandagha ma mabwe.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Okihi litumu li bamfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Nyaã nswe mbwuru akala kunsa litumu li bamfumu ba baatkatumu. Mu kuulu, nswe litumu liikafa kundaa Nzaami, ya yini a Nzaami aakagwa nswe litumu. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Me mu obo, munde wu aakabihi litumu, nde aakatemene nsumu ya litumu li otwulu Nzaami. Babo ba baakatemene nsumu ya litumu li Nzaami sa babagha masyeme mu manyuru ma bo. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Mu kuulu, ba baakasa bubwe ka baakakala a nzalamweẽ a bamfumu o, lo ba baakasa bubi baakakala a nzalamweẽ. Kala ti we ka dzyi okala a nzalamweẽ a mfumu o, sa bubwe ya nde sa agwa we masyighi. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Mu kuulu, mfumu aakasalala Nzaami mu nkooro a bubwe bu we. Lo kala ti we si bubi, kala a nzalamweẽ, mu kuulu ka ku obwunu o mfumu ali a lipee, nde aakasalala Nzaami mu osyeme ya mu osuo nkehe a nde kundaa wu aakasalala bubi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Me mu obo okihi litumu li bamfumu oli mupfunu, ka yini a mu nkooro obara nzalamweẽ a nkehe o, lo mu nkooro a embwuru ki ebwe si.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Me mu obo si be liikafiri mpagha. Mu kuulu esala ki okatolo mpagha, Nzaami áagwi bo kye. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Liikafiri kundaa nswe mbwuru ebyimi ki lili a be ya nde: Mpagha kundaa wu lifaana ofiri mpagha yi mawa-mawa, nzalamweẽ kundaa wu lifaana okala a be nzalamweẽ, budziri kundaa wu lifaana ogwa be budziri.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzyi lili be a be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ka likakala a ebyimi e mbwuru o, kala ka yini a okadzyi banganda be a be o. Mu kuulu munde wu aadzyi nganda, aakuhu Mikyene. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Mu kuulu, mikele mi: «Ka bvughu mbughu ya mukala bwunu we mulumu a nganda o, ka dzwa o, ka turu o, ka sughu mukolo o,» ya mikele myehene mi mike, bákuru mye mu ndagha yi: «Dzyi nganda-mbwuru ti bu budzyi we nyuru a we<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-17">Opa 20.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-22">Det 5.17-22</ref></char></note>». <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Dzyi ka liikasa bubi kundaa nganda-mbwuru o: Dzyi me okughu ku Mikyene.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okala mukughu mu ogya o Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Bu ligyighili osoolo mu nki matala lili: Ma ngu matala ma lifaana osighili be mu ensama, mu kuulu, lolo bu obvwughu obvulu obehene ya bihi-a-be. Obvwughu oko ka ofirisyili la ti mu matala mamo ma lísi bihi-a-be kana o. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Mpyibi ayi la, bwihi ayi ku bele a okya. Mu obo litswe litsili bigyighili bibi mpyibi, ya litswe lilaha bidzwana bii otsyeme. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Litswe likadzyara bwunu a bu ofaana, ti anga mu mwiĩ wu ebala, wene a byiri bibi bilyili ya bibi oŋma mala malagha, wene a esighi ya enkwunu, wene a mumbaŋana ya ebaa ki elagha. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Lo be lifaana olaha Mfumu Yiisu-Kriste ti anga eko ya linyaã ofirikagyighili mi ookadzyi musunu, mu okuhu dzyi li yo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ka lamana ndughu a we mu kana o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Libwana a munde wu gwene a mpini mu kana, gwene a otsaala a bitsimi bi nde. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Mbwuru mumõ li a kana mu odza bilogho byehene. Wu muke, wu gwene a mpini mu kana, nde okadza yini a bisagha. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Munde wu aakadza anyaã otsaala wu aagwene okadza, ya munde wu aagwene okadza anyaã olamana wu aakadza, mu kuulu Nzaami aabwana nde. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />We, we nande li mu olamana musala a mbwuru mukimi? Ngu okala ti nde li mu mukiri, bwunu we nde aabwi, mimye mitala mfumu a nde. Ya nde sa agyighili otemene, mu kuulu Mfumu li a lileene lii otehebe nde.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Mu kuulu, mu kana li mfu-nga-empele bitsughu bini bibvulu bibike mupfunu, mu kaana lili wu muke, bitsughu byehene bili nsihi mu mupfunu. Nyaã nswe mbwuru, mu mayele ma nde, akala a kana mu bitsimi bibi ndaa ndeme. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Munde wu aakagwa bitsughu mupfunu me mu nkooro a Mfumu aakasa obo. Munde wu aakadza, me mu nkooro a Mfumu aakadza, mu kuulu nde aakabvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami ŋa aakasa nde obo. Wu aagwene okadza, me mu nkooro a Mfumu nde aagwene okadza. Ndehe si aakabvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami ŋa aakasa nde obo. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Mu kuulu, mbwuru si mumõ mu bihi-a-be ka li mweẽ mu ndeme o, ya mbwuru si mumõ ka kughu okpa mu nkooro a ndeme o. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Mu kuulu, kala ti bihi-a-be lili mweẽ, lo bihi lili mweẽ mu nkooro a Mfumu. Ya kala ti bihi liikakpa, bihi mu nkooro a Mfumu liikakpa. Bihi ngu likala mweẽ, bihi ngu likpi, bihi lili baara ba Mfumu. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Mu kuulu, kala ti Kriste ákpi ya asighili mu lipfu, me mu okala Mfumu a ba bákpi ya baba mweẽ. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Lo we, mu emakye we li mu olamana ndughu a we mu kana? Bwunu we, mu emakye we li mu otsaala ndughu a we mu kana? Mu kuulu, sa balamana bihi bwohono ŋa mbala a muyala a Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Mu kuulu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«Me Mfumu wu a mweẽ ndyele yo,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«nswe mbwuru sa akunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a me,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«ya muŋma wu a nswe mbwuru sa alyele mandagha ma maagwa Nzaami masyighi!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Edz 45.23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:18">49.18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:24">Dze 22.24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:11">Edze 5.11</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Obo me buulu, nswe mbwuru mu bihi-a-be sa balamana nde ŋa nkulu a Nzaami mu mi aagyighili nde ndeme.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogwene obwihi ndughu mu kana mu lisumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Mu obo, litswe linyaã ofirikalamana babake. Liswe ligwolo munkaana wu ogwene otwulu limeẽ li liisa ti bandughu mu kana bakubu makya, bwunu we libwihi bo mu masumu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Me ngyighili osoolo, ya me nsi kana ti mu Mfumu Yiisu ka oli a elogho ki esuŋumu mu kyeme o. Lo kala ti mbwuru tsimi ti elogho eli ki esuŋumu, kundaa nde elogho ekye sa ekala ki esuŋumu. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Kala ti, mu nkooro a bi-odza, ndughu a we mu kana aanyoõ, we ka li mu ofirikadzyara bwunu a bu oli dzyi o. Mu nkooro a bi-odza, ka sa kuulu ti munde wuulu Kriste ákpi mu nkooro a nde apfighili o. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Mu obo, mbwuru anyaã otsaala ekye kiili kundaa be eli ki ebwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Mu kuulu Emfumu e Nzaami ka etala odza ya oŋma o. Lo kye etala bunsumu, edzuunu ya esee bi ookagwa Mufulu a Ngili. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Munde wu aakasalala Kriste obo, Nzaami aakadzyi nde, ya baara baakakihi nde.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Obo me buulu, litswe lisa mpini mu okasa mandagha ma maakagwa edzuunu ya ma maakakwuhu bihi-a-be. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ka dzwa esala e Nzaami mu nkooro a bi-odza o. Ngaŋma, bilogho byehene bili tse-tse. Lo oli bubi kundaa mbwuru mu odza bilogho bi biikasa kuulu ti babake bakubu kya. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Oli bubwe mu onyaã odza tuo ya oŋma mala ma bviini, mu obihi bilogho byehene bi bili limeẽ li ookubu ndughu a we mu kana makya. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Kana li li a we, kebe lo we weme ŋa nkulu a Nzaami. Esee kundaa munde wu aagwene okalamana nde ndeme ŋa aakagwolo nde mukaana mu mi aagyighili! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Lo munde wu aakeŋe mu bi aadza, nde aabagha masyeme. Mu kuulu ndagha yi aagyighili nde ka yifi mu kana li nde o. Ankoho, myehene mi miigwene okafa mu kana, mili masumu.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ogwa nganda-mbwuru esee, lo ka ki e weme o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Kala ti bihi-a-be lili a mpini mu kana, lifaana obaha ba bagwene a mpini mu kana, lo ka yini a mu okagyighili mandagha ma maakagwa bihi bameme esee o. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Nyaã nswe mbwuru mu bihi-a-be akagyighili mandagha ma maagwa nganda-mbwuru esee mu nkooro a bubwe ya okulu o nde. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Mu kuulu Kriste ka ágyighili mandagha ma mákagwa ndeme esee o, lo ti bwunu a bu básono: «Bitughu bi babo ba bali mu okatughu we biibwi mu me.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Bik 69.10</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Mu kuulu, mandagha mwohono ma básono mu nsi-nkulu, básono mo mpaala bihi-a-be libagha maluo, buulu mu mukama ya mu mpama yi ookagwa Bisono, bihi-a-be likala a emiini. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nyaã Nzaami wu aakagwa mukama ya mpama asa kuulu ti be likala bitsimi bimõ be a be, ti bwunu a bu odzyi Yiisu-Kriste, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />mpaala mu bitsimi bimõ ya mu mbiili mõ, be lisyighi Nzaami, Taara a Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste!<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kriste musala a baara bwohono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Me mu obo, liikabwana a babake be a be, ti bwunu a bu óbwana a be Kriste ndeme, mu nkooro a nsia a Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Mu kuulu, me ndyele ti Kriste ayi musala a ba básomo nzo a mbaa, mu nkooro a engaŋma e Nzaami, mpaala misiini mi bágwi kundaa bataara mikeele. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Lo baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o baakagwa Nzaami nsia mu nkooro a nyiĩ yi aakasuo nde, ti bwunu a bu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Me mu obo me sa kansyighi we ŋa kara li bikaana»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«ya me sa kangyimi mu nsia a nkwumu a we<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Sam 22.50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:50">Bik 18.50</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Bisono bifirikalyele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">«Bikaana, likala mu esee ya ekaana ki oosuolo Mfumu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Det 32.43</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ya báfirisono bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">«Bikaana byehene, ligwa Mfumu nsia,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">«nyaã baara bwohono bagwa nde masyighi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Bik 117.1</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Edzayi si ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Nde sa akala apala, mu musyi a dzumu li Dzese,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«munde wu akala aatemene mu otumu bikaana.»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Bikaana bibye sa bisa emiini mu nde<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Edz 11.1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 4:17">Rut 4.17</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1">1 Sam 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 11-13">11–13</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Nyaã Nzaami wu aakagwa emiini aluhu be mu esee kyehene ya mu edzuunu kyehene mu nkooro a kana li be, kuulu be lilwulu mu emiini mu lileene li Mufulu a Ngili!<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esala e Poole kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, mu mi mitala be, me ndi a kana ti be liilwulu mu mukolo mubwe, be lili a ligyahaba lwohono, ya be liikughu mu okagyehe banganda be a be. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Lo mu mambughu mana, me aansono be ya kaaha mu mukaana wu ti anga mu olibili be mweẽ mu mi bágyihi be, mu nkooro a bwehe bu ógwi me Nzaami, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />mu okala musala a Yiisu-Kriste kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. Me aangwi nyuru me yohono mu esala ki e ngili ki e Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Nzaami, mpaala baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bakala ekaba ki ookihi Nzaami, ki ootsehebe Mufulu a Ngili. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Me mu obo me ndi a mutwunu mu Yiisu-Kriste, mu mi mitala esala e Nzaami. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Mu kuulu me ka nkughu obili mu ndagha nkimi o, kala ka yini a mu mi ógyighili Kriste mu me o, mu okabiri baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bakala a bintamana mu mbiili ya mu bigyighili, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />mu lileene li bilyimi ya lili bimaã, mu lileene li Mufulu a Nzaami. Me mu obo, me bu nsehene obaana ku Yerusaleme tee ku Iliri, me aantsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Kriste mu bibini byehene. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Lo me aangwi mukolo a me mu otsala Nsia yi Mbwe mu bibini biili nkini ka bámaatuolo nkwumu a Kriste o, mpaala me nyaã otwu ŋa yulu a bitsini bi bibagha bi nzo a mbwuru mukimi. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Lo ti bwunu a bu básono:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">«Kundaa baala ka bátwoho bo nsia a nde o, sa bamono nde,»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">«ya babo baala ka bágyughu nsia a nde o, sa babaghala<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Edz 52.15</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitsimi bi ókuru Poole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Me ndagha oyo yiikakahaba me mansa malagha mu oyamono be. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Lo mu matala ma, me ka afirinsyili a esala mu bitsulu bi nsie bibye o, ya obaana bamvulu balagha, me ndi a nzala a oyamono be ku olagha, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ŋa akala aangye me ku nsie yi a Esepaanye. Me ndi a emiini ti me sa mono be ŋa akala aanduru me, ya me sa ngyagha bilogho bi aankala a me nzala a bye mu midzye, ŋa mbihi a ŋa aankuhu me dzyi li me lili oluhu mana matala emõ ya be.<verse eid="ROM 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Lo mu matala ma, me ngyene ku Yerusaleme mu yibaha ba bangili baba li oko. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Mu kuulu baara baba bitsulu bi nsie bibi Masedwane ya Akayi, baamono bubwe mu otolo nzi, yi ogwa libaha kundaa bawele ŋa kara li ba bangili ba bali ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Bo baagwolo munkaana mu ogyighili ndagha oyo, mu kuulu bo bali a ebyimi e bo. Kala ti baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, baabagha kaba mu busini bu ookagwa mufulu, boho si bafaana osalala bo mu mi mitala bilogho bi bo bibi musunu. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Me mana ndagha yi, ya ogwa ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono bikaba bi baatolo, me sa bulunduru kundaa be ŋa aangye me ku Esepaanye. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Me nsoolo ti ŋa aayamono me be, me sa ngya a liseme lili mukughu lili Kriste.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Lo bandughu ba me mu kana, me ngwi be mpama mu nkwumu a Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste ya mu dzyi li ookagwa Mufulu, mu odzwana mvulu emõ ya me mu okabuono Nzaami mu nkooro a me, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />mpaala me mbvwughu ŋa myaã mi ba bagwene a kana mu Mfumu ba bali mu etsulu e nsie kii Yude, ya libaha li aambiri me, ba bangili ku Yerusaleme, bo bagyagha lo bubwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Obo me buulu mu esee me sa yamono be mu waa li Nzaami, ya me sa mbagha mana matala mama ogwumu kundaa be.<verse eid="ROM 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nyaã Nzaami wu edzuunu akala ya be bwohono! «Aamene!»<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mamboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Me ngweghe be Foyebe, nkele a bihi, wu li musala mu libwunu li Nzaami lili mu bvulu lili Senkere, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />mu kuulu be libwana a nde mu nkwumu a Mfumu, bwunu a bu ofaana mu ba bangili. Libaha nde mu nswe ndagha yi aakala a nde nzala a be. Mu kuulu nde ábaha baara balagha, ngu okala meme si.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ligwa Pirisika ya Akila, bandughu ba me ba esala mu Yiisu-Kriste, mboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Bo ba bákihi ogwa mitswi mi bo mu obvwuhu laama li me. Ka oli yini a me ngasighi ndi mu okabvurulu bo matuono o, lo si ya Mabwunu ma Nzaami mwohono mama baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o mali mu okabvurulu bo matuono. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Ligwa si libwunu li Nzaami li liikabvuŋunu mu nzo a bo mboro. Ligwa Epayinete, ndughu a me wu mukolo, mboro, nde wu li wu a nsomo mu osa kana mu Kriste ku nsie yi a Adzi. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Ligwa Mari mboro, nde wu aamono mpara yi alagha mu nkooro a be. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Ligwa Andoronikose ya Yunyase mamboro, bo bali badzighi ba me ya bo bali si bandughu ba ándi a me mu boloko. Bo bali baara baba budziri bu bulagha ŋa kara li bantumu, ya bo bási kana mu Kriste nsomo ya me. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Ligwa Ampilyatuse, ndughu a me wu mukolo mu Mfumu, mboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ligwa Urubẽ, ndughu a bihi wu esala mu Kriste, ya Sitakise, ndughu a me wu mukolo mamboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ligwa Apelese mboro, nde wu aasuo bigyighili bi kana li nde mu Kriste. Ligwa baara ba nzo a Arisitobule mamboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ligwa Erodyõ mudzighi a me mboro. Ligwa baara ba nzo a Narasise ba bali mu Mfumu mamboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ligwa Tirifene ya Tirifose, bakaha ba bákasala esala kii mpini mu Mfumu, mamboro. Ligwa Pereside, ndughu wu mukolo wu mukaha, mboro, nde wu ásala ku olagha mu Mfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Ligwa Rufuse, wu oosuolo Mfumu ya ngughu a nde wu li ngughu a mehe si, mamboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ligwa Asekirite, Felengo, Eremese, Patorobase, Eremase ya bandughu mu kana ba bali ya bo mamboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ligwa mamboro kundaa Filolonge ya Dzuli, Neere ya nkele a nde wu mukaha, Olimpase ya baba ngili bwohono ba bali emõ ya bo. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ligwihini a mamboro be a be mu onyuburu ku ofaana ya kuu baana ba Nzaami.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:16">Mabwunu ma Kriste mwohono magwi be mamboro.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogyehe kuu masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Bandughu mu kana, me ngwi be mpama mu kuulu be lisa mayele mu baara ba baakasa munkabala ŋa kara li banga-a-kana ya baakabwihi bo mu masumu, mu mandagha mama lisobo ya maluo ma liigyagha be. Likala la ya bo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Mu kuulu baara baba obo ka bali basala ba Mfumu a bihi Kriste o, lo bo baakasala mu oluhu mila mi bomo. Mu mbiili a bo yimbwe ya yi maluono, bo baakabulupfiri baara ba bagwene soolo mandagha bubwe. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Mu mi mitala be, baara bwohono basoolo bintamana bi be. Mu obo me aakamono esee mu nkooro a be, lo me ndzyi ti be likala bansughu mu mi mibwe, bwunu a bu lili be baba tse-tse mu mi mitala bubi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Edzi-dzighi, Nzaami wu edzuunu sa apweene Satana ku nsie a myili mi be.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Nyaã bwehe bu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu bukala ya be!<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timote, ndughu a me wu esala, emõ ya badzighi ba me Lusiyuse, Yasõ ya Sosipatere, bagwi be mamboro. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Me Teretiyuse, wu nsono mandagha ma olyele poole mu mukaana wu, me ngwi be mamboro mu nkwumu Mfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Ngayuse, wu aabwana me ya libwunu li Nzaami lwohono mu nzo a nde, gwi be mamboro. Erasete, wu aakakebe nzi a bvulu, gwi be mamboro, bumo si ya Kwaratuse, ndughu mu kana. [<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Nyaã bwehe bu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste bukala ya be bwohono! Aamene]<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsia kundaa Nzaami, nsughu nga-mumõ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Nsia kundaa Nzaami! Nde li a lileene lili ogwa be mpini, mu Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Yiisu-Kriste yi aakabulunsala me. Mu Nsia yi Mbwe oyo, Nzaami aasuo mansweghe ma básweghe obaana mu ebaana, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />lo mo maamoŋono mu matala ma mu bisono bi libighi, ti bwunu a bu oli litumu li Nzaami wu li mu mibvu ya mibvu. Ya bikaana byehene bisoolo mo, mu kuulu bye bisa kana ya bikala a bintamana mu nde. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Nyaã nsia yikala kundaa Nzaami, nsughu nga-mumõ, mu Yiisu-Kriste, mu mibvu ya mibvu! «Aamene!»<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>